    "schema": "manual-nested-band-decision/1",
    "base_commit": "911f9b77c470d619e8f7f0f106d9864b440d3923",
    "case": "B / 2884 / broad months review",
    "user_quote": "我會認同方案二，原因是方案一裡面有方案二，方案一是一個大帶，但是裡面有很多小帶，重點是這些小帶若帶量突破小帶，可能就有機會突破大帶，若大帶價量配合突破就有機會走出行情。",
    "adjudication": "ANSWERED_NESTED_LARGE_AND_SMALL_BANDS",
    "stated_option_choice": "OPTION_2_WITH_EXPLICIT_LARGE_BAND_CONTAINMENT",
